  "key": 8607,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0881_SR201_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hey, you saw that news\n",
        "report that was on TV, right?\r",
        "You know, “Search for the Red\n",
        "GYARADOS! The mysterious appearance\\fof the furious Pokémon in a lake!”\r",
        "That show got me to thinking.\r",
        "I’ll bet our local lake has a Pokémon\n",
        "like that in it, too!\r",
        "So, that’s what we’re gonna do.\n",
        "We’ll go find a Pokémon like that!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0881_SR201_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hey!\n",
        "Where are you wandering off to?!\r",
        "That mystery Pokémon on TV!\n",
        "It’s calling out to me!\r",
        "Forget about going back home!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0881_SR201_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Remember what your mother said?\r",
        "Mom: “{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Don’t go into the tall grass!\r",
        "“Remember, wild Pokémon may attack\n",
        "you if you’re walking in tall grass.\r",
        "“It would be OK if you had your\n",
        "own Pokémon, but...”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0881_SR201_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hey, it’s those people!\n",
        "Is that old guy staring at us?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0881_SR201_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor: Hmm...\r",
        "I heard from {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} that\n",
        "you used our Pokémon?\\fLet me see them, please.\r",
        "Hmm...\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0} and {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0}...\r",
        "...\r",
        "Hmm...\\fI see...\n",
        "That’s how it is...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0881_SR201_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "I’m going back to my lab!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0881_SR201_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Um... Yes!\n",
        "Professor, please wait for me!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0881_SR201_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "I think you should visit our lab\n",
        "later.\r",
        "OK, see you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0881_SR201_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Uh... Yeah, of course!\n",
        "Professor, wait for me!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0881_SR201_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "You should visit us at our lab later,\n",
        "I think.\r",
        "We’ll be seeing you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0881_SR201_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: What was all that\n",
        "craziness about?\r",
        "I mean, if he was angry, he could’ve\n",
        "just yelled at us, or whatever...\r",
        "And didn’t he want their Pokémon\n",
        "back...?\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}...\n",
        "We should go home, too...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0881_SR201_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Wild Pokémon lurk in tall grass. They\n",
        "can come bursting out at any time.\r",
        "So, if you’re wanting to battle wild\n",
        "Pokémon, just walk in tall grass.\r",
        "If you want to avoid wild Pokémon,\n",
        "then stay out of the tall grass."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0881_SR201_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi!\n",
        "I work at a Pokémon Mart.\r",
        "Did you know that a Pokémon’s health\n",
        "is measured by Hit Points (HP)?\r",
        "If a Pokémon runs out of HP, it\n",
        "faints and can’t battle anymore.\r",
        "If a Pokémon’s HP gets low, you\n",
        "should heal it with a Potion.\r",
        "Here, let me give you a Potion as\n",
        "a free sample. First one’s free!\r",
        "It will automatically go in the\n",
        "Medicine Pocket of your Bag.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0881_SR201_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "You can find a Pokémon Mart in cities\n",
        "and most major towns."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0881_SR201_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "That ledge is one way. Jump down\n",
        "for a shortcut to Twinleaf Town!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0881_SR201_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "If your Pokémon’s health--that’s its\n",
        "HP--is getting low, you should go\\fhome and get some rest."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0881_SR201_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "If your Pokémon’s health--that’s its\n",
        "HP--is getting low, you should go\\fto a Pokémon Center!"
      ]
    },
    {
